  "notes": "Used for official, formal statements typically by governments, organizations, or public figures.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {声明|せいめい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{発表|はっぴょう}→発表：03562_happyou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to issue a statement)\n- {声明|せいめい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧ (to put out a statement)\n- ⟦{共同|きょうどう}→共同：02591_kyoudou⟧{声明|せいめい} (joint statement)\n- ⟦{公式|こうしき}→公式：04167_koushiki⟧{声明|せいめい} (official statement)\n- {声明|せいめい}⟦{文|ぶん}→文：03716_bun⟧ (text of a statement)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- ⟦{姓名|せいめい}→姓名：03764_seimei⟧ - full name (surname + given name)\n- ⟦{生命|せいめい}→生命：03296_seimei⟧ - life (biological)\n\nThese three words are all read せいめい but have completely different meanings.",
